  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふだん　やわらかい　あたまの　トゲは\nちからを　こめると　するどく　とがり\nいわをも　つらぬくほど　かたくなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 가시는 평소에는 부드럽지만\n힘을 주면 뾰족하고 날카로워지며\n바위를 뚫어 버릴 정도로 단단해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il rassemble ses forces, les piquants souples\nqui recouvrent sa tête deviennent si durs et acérés\nqu’ils pourraient transpercer un rocher.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn es seine Kraft auf die sonst eher weichen\nStacheln auf seinem Kopf konzentriert, werden\ndiese robust genug, um damit Steine zu zertrümmern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando acumula energía, las suaves púas de su\ncabeza se vuelven tan duras y afiladas que hasta\npueden atravesar rocas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può indurire le punte che ha sulla testa, di solito\nmorbide, per farle diventare talmente affilate e\nappuntite da penetrare nella roccia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The quills on its head are usually soft.\nWhen it flexes them, the points become\nso hard and sharp that they can pierce rock.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "普段　やわらかい　頭の　トゲは\n力を　こめると　鋭く　とがり\n岩をも　つらぬくほど　硬くなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando acumula energía, las suaves púas de su\ncabeza se vuelven tan duras y afiladas que hasta\npueden atravesar rocas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまと　せなかを　かたい　カラで\nおおわれているため　トラックが\nぶつかってきても　へっちゃらだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리와 등이 단단한 껍데기로\n덮여 있기 때문에 트럭이\n부딪혀와도 아무렇지 않다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa tête et son dos sont recouverts d’une carapace\ntellement dure que même une collision avec\nun camion ne lui ferait rien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Kopf und Rücken werden von einer harten Hülle\nbedeckt, die so robust ist, dass sie selbst einer\nKollision mit einem LKW standhalten würde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La robusta coraza que le recubre la cabeza y la\nespalda lo protege de tal manera que podría\nchocar contra un camión y permanecer impasible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha schiena e testa coperte da un guscio talmente\nresistente che non farebbe una piega nemmeno se\nci passasse sopra un tir.",
